{"kind":"html","caption":"前序遍历的区间首元素就是当前子树的根；在中序遍历中找到它后，左、右两段分别对应左右子树。动画用示例 1 逐步展示区间切分，并同步把新节点接入二叉树。借助值到中序下标的映射，每个节点只需定位一次，时间复杂度为 O(n)，递归栈与树高相关。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>从前序与中序遍历构造二叉树</title>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  html, body{ margin: 0; background: #1c1c1c; color: #d4d4d4; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif; font-size: 15px; }\n  body{ padding: 28px; }\n  main{ width: 100%; max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; }\n  h1 { margin: 0 0 10px; color: #fff; font-size:14px; }\n  .lead { margin: 0; color: #b8b8b8; line-height: 1.7; }\n  .panel { margin-top: 22px; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #444; border-radius: 12px; background: #252526; }\n  .panel-title { margin-bottom: 16px; color: #fff; font-weight: 650; font-size: 17px; }\n  .legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px 18px; margin-top: 16px; color: #b8b8b8; font-size: 13px; }\n  .legend span { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; }\n  .dot { width: 13px; height: 13px; border-radius: 3px; background: #333; border: 1px solid #666; }\n  .dot.active { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .sequence-block + .sequence-block { margin-top: 20px; }\n  .sequence-name { margin-bottom: 9px; color: #d4d4d4; }\n  .sequence { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(62px, 1fr)); gap: 10px; }\n  .cell { min-height: 69px; padding: 10px 8px 8px; border: 1px solid #555; border-radius: 8px; background: #303030; text-align: center; transition: background .35s, border-color .35s, color .35s; }\n  .value { display: block; color: #ddd; font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; }\n  .index { display: block; margin-top: 7px; color: #999; font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 13px; }\n  .cell.active { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .cell.active .value { color: #fff; }\n  .cell.root-cell { background: #0e639c; border-color: #7dbbff; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px #3794ff; }\n  .cell.dim { opacity: .38; }\n  .workspace { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(290px, .85fr) minmax(360px, 1.15fr); gap: 22px; align-items: start; margin-top: 22px; }\n  .step-card { min-height: 235px; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #444; border-radius: 12px; background: #252526; }\n  .step-count { color: #3794ff; font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 14px; }\n  .step-title { margin: 10px 0 12px; color: #fff; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; }\n  .step-desc { min-height:48px; margin: 0; line-height: 1.75; color: #d4d4d4; }\n  .formula { margin-top: 16px; padding: 12px; border-left: 3px solid #3794ff; border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0; background: #1c1c1c; color: #c8e1ff; font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.65; }\n  .tree-card { padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #444; border-radius: 12px; background: #252526; }\n  .tree { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(55px, 1fr)); grid-template-rows: auto 34px auto 34px auto; gap: 0 10px; align-items: center; min-height: 310px; }\n  .node { width: 58px; min-height: 58px; margin: auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; border: 2px solid #555; border-radius: 50%; background: #303030; color: #777; font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; opacity: .25; transition: opacity .35s, background .35s, border-color .35s, color .35s; }\n  .node small { margin-top: 2px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; }\n  .node.visible { opacity: 1; color: #fff; border-color: #3794ff; background: #0e639c; }\n  .edge { height: 34px; width: 2px; margin: auto; background: #555; opacity: .2; transition: opacity .35s, background .35s; }\n  .edge.left { transform: rotate(36deg); transform-origin: top; }\n  .edge.right { transform: rotate(-36deg); transform-origin: top; }\n  .edge.visible { opacity: 1; background: #3794ff; }\n  #n3 { grid-column: 2 / 4; grid-row: 1; }\n  #e39 { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 2; }\n  #e320 { grid-column: 3; grid-row: 2; }\n  #n9 { grid-column: 1 / 3; grid-row: 3; }\n  #n20 { grid-column: 3 / 5; grid-row: 3; }\n  #e2015 { grid-column: 3; grid-row: 4; }\n  #e207 { grid-column: 4; grid-row: 4; }\n  #n15 { grid-column: 2 / 4; grid-row: 5; transform: translateX(-25%); }\n  #n7 { grid-column: 3 / 5; grid-row: 5; transform: translateX(25%); }\n  .result { margin-top: 22px; padding: 18px 20px; border: 1px solid #444; border-radius: 12px; background: #252526; line-height: 1.7; }\n  .result code { color: #9cdcfe; font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .progress { height: 4px; margin-top: 18px; border-radius: 4px; background: #3a3a3a; overflow: hidden; }\n  .progress-bar { height: 100%; width: 0; background: #3794ff; }\n  @media (max-width: 760px) {\n    body{ padding: 18px; }\n    .workspace { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .sequence { grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(48px, 1fr)); gap: 6px; }\n    .cell { padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; }\n  }\n  /* COMPACT */ html,body{font-size:12px!important;line-height:1.45!important}body{padding:8px 10px 10px!important}main{max-width:560px!important}h1{font-size:14px!important;margin:0 0 4px!important;color:#d4d4d4!important}.lead{font-size:12px!important;color:#8d8d8d!important;margin:0 0 6px!important}.panel,.step-card,.tree-card,.result{padding:8px 10px!important;border-radius:6px!important;margin-top:8px!important;border:1px solid #3c3c3c!important}.panel-title{font-size:13px!important;margin-bottom:6px!important}.sequence{grid-template-columns:repeat(5,38px)!important;gap:6px!important;justify-content:start}.cell{min-height:48px!important;padding:4px 2px!important;border-radius:4px!important;border-width:1px!important}.value{font-size:14px!important}.index{font-size:10px!important;color:#8d8d8d!important}.workspace{display:grid!important;grid-template-columns:1fr!important;gap:8px!important;margin-top:8px!important}.step-card{min-height:auto!important}.step-title{font-size:14px!important;margin:6px 0!important}.step-desc{font-size:12px!important;min-height:auto!important}.formula{border-left-width:3px!important;padding:8px 10px!important;font-size:11px!important}.tree{min-height:auto!important;gap:4px!important}.node{width:36px!important;min-height:36px!important;font-size:12px!important;border-width:1px!important}.progress{height:3px!important;margin-top:8px!important}.legend{font-size:10px!important;margin-top:8px!important}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <h1>前序定根，中序分左右</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">示例：<span style=\"font-family:'SF Mono',Monaco,Menlo,monospace\">preorder = [3,9,20,15,7]</span>，<span style=\"font-family:'SF Mono',Monaco,Menlo,monospace\">inorder = [9,3,15,20,7]</span></p>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\">遍历区间</div>\n    <div class=\"sequence-block\">\n      <div class=\"sequence-name\">前序：区间第一个数是当前根</div>\n      <div class=\"sequence\" id=\"preorder\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sequence-block\">\n      <div class=\"sequence-name\">中序：根左边属于左子树，右边属于右子树</div>\n      <div class=\"sequence\" id=\"inorder\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"legend\">\n      <span><i class=\"dot active\"></i>当前根或切分位置</span>\n      <span><i class=\"dot\"></i>当前递归区间</span>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"workspace\">\n    <section class=\"step-card\">\n      <div class=\"step-count\" id=\"stepCount\"></div>\n      <div class=\"step-title\" id=\"stepTitle\"></div>\n      <p class=\"step-desc\" id=\"stepDesc\"></p>\n      <div class=\"formula\" id=\"formula\"></div>\n      <div class=\"progress\"><div class=\"progress-bar\" id=\"progressBar\"></div></div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"tree-card\">\n      <div class=\"panel-title\">逐步生成的二叉树</div>\n      <div class=\"tree\">\n        <div class=\"node\" id=\"n3\">3<small>根</small></div>\n        <div class=\"edge left\" id=\"e39\"></div>\n        <div class=\"edge right\" id=\"e320\"></div>\n        <div class=\"node\" id=\"n9\">9<small>左</small></div>\n        <div class=\"node\" id=\"n20\">20<small>右</small></div>\n        <div class=\"edge left\" id=\"e2015\"></div>\n        <div class=\"edge right\" id=\"e207\"></div>\n        <div class=\"node\" id=\"n15\">15<small>左</small></div>\n        <div class=\"node\" id=\"n7\">7<small>右</small></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"result\">\n    最终按层序表示为 <code>[3,9,20,null,null,15,7]</code>。先建立“值 → 中序下标”的映射，可把每次寻找切分点从线性扫描降为常数时间，总时间复杂度为 <code>O(n)</code>。\n  </section>\n</main>\n<script>\n(() => {\n  const pre = [3, 9, 20, 15, 7];\n  const ino = [9, 3, 15, 20, 7];\n  const preBox = document.getElementById('preorder');\n  const inBox = document.getElementById('inorder');\n\n  function makeCells(box, values, prefix) {\n    values.forEach((value, index) => {\n      const cell = document.createElement('div');\n      cell.className = 'cell';\n      cell.id = prefix + index;\n      cell.innerHTML = '<span class=\"value\">' + value + '</span><span class=\"index\">下标 ' + index + '</span>';\n      box.appendChild(cell);\n    });\n  }\n  makeCells(preBox, pre, 'p');\n  makeCells(inBox, ino, 'i');\n\n  const steps = [\n    {\n      title: '选择整棵树的根 3',\n      desc: '前序区间的第一个元素 3 必然是根。在中序下标 1 找到 3，于是左侧 [9] 是左子树，右侧 [15,20,7] 是右子树。',\n      formula: '左子树大小 = 1 - 0 = 1\\n右子树前序起点 = 0 + 1 + 1 = 2',\n      preRange: [0,4], inRange: [0,4], preRoot: 0, inRoot: 1,\n      nodes: ['n3'], edges: []\n    },\n    {\n      title: '构造左子树 9',\n      desc: '左子树只有一个元素。前序首元素与中序唯一元素都是 9，因此它是叶子节点，左右区间均为空。',\n      formula: 'preorder[1..1] ↔ inorder[0..0]\\n根 = 9，左空，右空',\n      preRange: [1,1], inRange: [0,0], preRoot: 1, inRoot: 0,\n      nodes: ['n3','n9'], edges: ['e39']\n    },\n    {\n      title: '构造右子树 20',\n      desc: '右子树的前序区间首元素是 20。它在中序下标 3，把当前中序区间切成左侧 [15] 与右侧 [7]。',\n      formula: 'preorder[2..4] ↔ inorder[2..4]\\n左子树大小 = 3 - 2 = 1',\n      preRange: [2,4], inRange: [2,4], preRoot: 2, inRoot: 3,\n      nodes: ['n3','n9','n20'], edges: ['e39','e320']\n    },\n    {\n      title: '接入 20 的左孩子 15',\n      desc: '切分后左侧区间都只有 15，所以 15 是叶子节点，并接到 20 的左边。',\n      formula: 'preorder[3..3] ↔ inorder[2..2]\\n根 = 15，左空，右空',\n      preRange: [3,3], inRange: [2,2], preRoot: 3, inRoot: 2,\n      nodes: ['n3','n9','n20','n15'], edges: ['e39','e320','e2015']\n    },\n    {\n      title: '接入 20 的右孩子 7',\n      desc: '最后一个区间只包含 7，它成为 20 的右孩子。所有递归区间处理完毕，树构造完成。',\n      formula: 'preorder[4..4] ↔ inorder[4..4]\\n构造结果 = [3,9,20,null,null,15,7]',\n      preRange: [4,4], inRange: [4,4], preRoot: 4, inRoot: 4,\n      nodes: ['n3','n9','n20','n15','n7'], edges: ['e39','e320','e2015','e207']\n    }\n  ];\n\n  let current = 0;\n  const duration = 2400;\n  const count = document.getElementById('stepCount');\n  const title = document.getElementById('stepTitle');\n  const desc = document.getElementById('stepDesc');\n  const formula = document.getElementById('formula');\n  const bar = document.getElementById('progressBar');\n\n  function paintRange(prefix, range, root) {\n    for (let i = 0; i < 5; i++) {\n      const cell = document.getElementById(prefix + i);\n      cell.className = 'cell';\n      if (i < range[0] || i > range[1]) cell.classList.add('dim');\n      else cell.classList.add('active');\n      if (i === root) cell.classList.add('root-cell');\n    }\n  }\n\n  function showStep(index) {\n    const s = steps[index];\n    count.textContent = '步骤 ' + (index + 1) + ' / ' + steps.length;\n    title.textContent = s.title;\n    desc.textContent = s.desc;\n    formula.textContent = s.formula;\n    paintRange('p', s.preRange, s.preRoot);\n    paintRange('i', s.inRange, s.inRoot);\n    document.querySelectorAll('.node').forEach(el => el.classList.toggle('visible', s.nodes.includes(el.id)));\n    document.querySelectorAll('.edge').forEach(el => el.classList.toggle('visible', s.edges.includes(el.id)));\n    bar.style.transition = 'none';\n    bar.style.width = '0%';\n    requestAnimationFrame(() => requestAnimationFrame(() => {\n      bar.style.transition = 'width ' + duration + 'ms linear';\n      bar.style.width = '100%';\n    }));\n  }\n\n  showStep(current);\n  setInterval(() => {\n    current = (current + 1) % steps.length;\n    showStep(current);\n  }, duration);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}
